From c4645e64cba953f2c7f292efb284a5e0f27b5452 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Romain=20Th=C3=A9ry?= <romain.thery@ik.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:50:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Zygote: Close the USAP session socket before specializing

A USAP closes the pool's listening socket before specializing but
keeps the accepted session socket and its command buffer open. The app
then closes the socket from its finalizer, where libcore's close()
calls getsockopt() on it and SELinux denies the app domain:

  avc: denied { getopt } for comm="FinalizerDaemon"
  path="/dev/socket/usap_pool_primary" scontext=u:r:untrusted_app:...
  tcontext=u:r:zygote:s0 tclass=unix_stream_socket

Free the command buffer once the arguments are parsed and close the
session socket after the pid is written back, while still in the
zygote's domain. With the pool enabled, ten app launches gave one
denial each before and none after.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: I896b7078d7e4cc4e94ca5c4726dc28647fc8396f
---
 core/java/com/android/internal/os/Zygote.java | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/java/com/android/internal/os/Zygote.java b/core/java/com/android/internal/os/Zygote.java
index cd17ed89058a1..609a094ee6a29 100644
--- a/core/java/com/android/internal/os/Zygote.java
+++ b/core/java/com/android/internal/os/Zygote.java
@@ -786,6 +786,7 @@ private static Runnable childMain(@Nullable ZygoteCommandBuffer argBuffer,
                     applyUidSecurityPolicy(args, peerCredentials);
                     // TODO (chriswailes): Should this only be run for debug builds?
                     validateUsapCommand(args);
+                    IoUtils.closeQuietly(tmpArgBuffer);
                     break;
                 } catch (Exception ex) {
                     Log.e("USAP", ex.getMessage());
@@ -833,6 +834,9 @@ private static Runnable childMain(@Nullable ZygoteCommandBuffer argBuffer,
                             + ioEx.getMessage());
                     throw new RuntimeException(ioEx);
                 } finally {
+                    // Close the session socket before specializing; otherwise the app's
+                    // finalizer closes it later, from a domain that may not query zygote sockets.
+                    IoUtils.closeQuietly(sessionSocket);
                     try {
                         // Since the raw FD is created by init and then loaded from an environment
                         // variable (as opposed to being created by the LocalSocketImpl itself),
